# Agile Retail – Full Stack Application

A full-stack application built using TypeScript, Node.js, Express and React. The project follows a monorepo architecture with separate backend and frontend applications, alongside shared packages for reusable code and types.

## Tech Stack

### Backend
- Node.js
- TypeScript
- Express.js
- Prisma ORM
- PostgreSQL
- Zod – Request validation
- Jest / Vitest – Testing
- Prettier – Code formatting

### Frontend
- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- ShadCN UI
- TanStack Query – Server state management
- TanStack Router – Client-side routing
- TanStack Table – Data tables

### Development Tools
- npm Workspaces
- Git
- Docker / Docker Compose
- ESLint
- Prettier

